sequenceDiagram
    participant Req as CompensationRequest
    participant Orig as Original MOV
    participant Comp as Compensation MOV
    Req->>Orig: request
    Orig-->>Req: validate
    Req->>Comp: invert source/destination
    Comp->>Orig: reference (compensation_for_movement_id)
    Orig->>Orig: status = COMPENSATED
